# Fallback if LOAD_TEST_OUTPUT_DIR is set to an absolute path outside the tree

# Relayer relay-submission store (transaction hashes the relayer has already
# broadcast). Runtime state only — never commit it, and never delete it while
# the relayer is running: it is what stops a restart from resubmitting a
# settled payment. See relayer/src/relay-submission-store.ts.
relay-submissions.json
relay-submissions.json.*.tmp
relayer/relay-submissions.json
relayer/relay-submissions.json.*.tmp

